    "id": "device_vendor_msft_appupdate_sources_{sourceid}_acceptsourceagreements",
    "description": "Authorizes Windows Package Manager to accept source agreements when AAU connects to this configured catalog source, including newly registered sources. Set to 1 only when the administrator has approved the source agreements. A value of 0, or an absent value, does not authorize acceptance; connection requiring acceptance fails without prompting. This setting does not accept package agreements or revoke agreements already accepted by Windows Package Manager.\r\n This setting is only available to Windows Insiders",
